---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<Layout
  title="About — SuretyResearch"
  description="SuretyResearch is the surety register for mortgage, insurance, and contractor files. The Alpharetta desk is Integrity First Insurance."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="kicker">About the desk</p>
      <h1>Built for the person who has to place the bond.</h1>
      <p>
        SuretyResearch is the register kept for mortgage, insurance, and contractor
        files. The phone number at the top of it is the owner's agency.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap story-grid">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>The question that started the file</h2>
        <p>
          When a license, a bid, or a court order needs a bond, the search usually ends in a quote
          form. The useful fact is smaller, and harder to find: which desk will write this form,
          in this state, with sources you can open.
        </p>
        <p class="pull">
          The Alpharetta desk and this register share an owner.
        </p>
        <h2>Alpharetta, on purpose</h2>
        <p>
          {SITE.owner} owns SuretyResearch and Integrity First Insurance, the Georgia agency inside
          the Cornerstone network. The public address is 925 North Point Parkway, Suite 475,
          Alpharetta. Cornerstone Licensing sits in Suite 470 on the same campus. Andrea runs IFI
          day to day. Jody is a producing agent.
        </p>
        <p>
          Travelers’ public agent directory lists surety among the lines at that address. A 2017
          Insurance Business America profile described Integrity First as the in-house agency of
          Cornerstone Support, focused on regulated operators. Bond work for licensed professionals
          is coordinated with Covered by Cornerstone and Cornerstone Surety Bonds.
        </p>
        <h2>Why the calculator became a register</h2>
        <p>
          The first version of this site was a premium calculator on a green page. The work people
          actually needed was a file: named agencies, sources on the card, and a phone number for
          the Alpharetta desk. That file is the register. The calculator stayed, as a sketch
          you run before the call.
        </p>
        <p>
          Each card shows signals we opened: BBB letter grades, AM Best when a page was in hand,
          years, coverage, series breadth. Names are listed A to Z.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="/methodology/">Read how the register is built</a>
        </p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a class="btn btn-brass" href="/agencies/">Open the register</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={`tel:${SITE.ifi.phone.replace(/-/g, '')}`}>Call {SITE.ifi.phone}</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="story-aside">
        <div class="cert">
          <p class="kicker">The Alpharetta desk</p>
          <h2>Integrity First Insurance</h2>
          <p>{SITE.affiliation}</p>
          <dl>
            <div>
              <dt>Where</dt>
              <dd>925 North Point Parkway, Suite 475, Alpharetta, GA 30005</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Who</dt>
              <dd>Andrea runs the agency day to day. Jody produces. {SITE.owner} owns the desk.</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Phone</dt>
              <dd><a href={`tel:${SITE.ifi.phone.replace(/-/g, '')}`}>{SITE.ifi.phone}</a></dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Hours</dt>
              <dd>Monday–Friday, 8am–6pm ET, as published on the Cornerstone sites.</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
          <a class="text-link" href="/agencies/integrity-first-insurance/">Open the IFI file</a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
